ps://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/644800235","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7492#issuecomment-644800235","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7492","id":644800235,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY0NDgwMDIzNQ==","user":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-06-16T14:26:24Z","updated_at":"2020-06-16T14:26:24Z","body":"There seem to be two (likely related) issues to do with preloading and seeking:\r\n1. After an ad pod coming up has preloaded, if the user seeks before it plays we get `pauseAd`/`stopAd` called for that ad pod. I think this is unexpected because `playAd` was never called for the ad.\r\n1. If the user seeks back, the ad pod never loads again.\r\n\r\nI've filed [Internal: b/159111848] to ask the IMA SDK team to take a look at this.\r\n\r\nIn the short term, 5a88e0bc1d37b8cd16f993ae51ebe17fa9358ab9 should avoid crashing for this case, and I'll plan to make another commit that will not treat this as an unexpected failure (to avoid discarding all ads) for (1). To address (2) I'll mark the preloaded ad as skipped at the moment when `stopAd` is unexpectedly called.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/644800235/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/subscript